  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOL: Fighting Fake News - Mis &amp; Dis-Information Training 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This proposed course will equip local Moldovan journalists (working on all platforms) and media students with the latest Open Source (OSINT) Intelligence journalistic skills and digital tools to help them better recognize and debunk mis and dis-information in order to benefit their audiences. Training is delivered in the form of a face-to-face workshop, along with a digital dossier of training which the trainees can work through in their own time, once the workshop is over. The workshop is highly interactive, ensuring participants get to immediately use the new skills they have been introduced to in a challenging but fun way. 
Since 2022, Beyond Broadcasting have been working with both the FCDO and local British Embassies in East and Southern Europe to deliver this course to local journalists.</narrative>
  </description>
